1
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,239
Move!

2
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:14,520
Your Majesty,

3
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:16,240
I have a very bad feeling about this.

4
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:18,199
This mark is very likely bait.

5
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,479
We can't keep following it.

6
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,560
That's impossible.

7
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,039
The person who knows this mark

8
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,840
grew up with me.

9
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,159
He'd never betray me.

10
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,039
Let's move.

11
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,520
Your Majesty, look.

12
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,599
Who made this mark?

13
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,120
Over here!

14
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:49,199
Capture the fugitives who kidnapped the King!

15
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:50,520
There's a huge reward!

16
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,719
Halt! Don't move!

17
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,199
Run!

18
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,599
Okay...

19
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,439
I can't run anymore.

20
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:12,879
I really can't run any further.

21
00:03:12,879 --> 00:03:14,960
Your Majesty, it's still too dangerous here.

22
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,120
We can't let our guard down.

23
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,120
Quick, take cover!

24
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,840
They said they ran this way.

25
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,520
Not a soul in sight.

26
00:03:34,919 --> 00:03:35,719
Where did they go?

27
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:39,120
What, you still want to claim the reward?

28
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,439
Don't you?

29
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,719
Think about that bounty.

30
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:43,520
How long would it take

31
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,919
to earn that much on your salary?

32
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:47,000
As if guys like us would ever get that lucky.

33
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Kidnapping the king

34
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,439
isn't something just anyone can pull off.

35
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,560
Yeah. Let's go.

36
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,759
I've dragged you into this.

37
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,560
There's no way I can ever leave

38
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,879
Antilocaris now.

39
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:02,919
Don't lose hope.

40
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,039
Rest assured,

41
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,240
I won't let you fall into their hands.

42
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:08,520
No matter where that place you mentioned is,

43
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,280
if we show our faces,

44
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:12,120
we'll definitely be recognized.

45
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,120
Don't worry.

46
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,759
I'll find a way. Trust me.

47
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,959
Okay.

48
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:21,879
Wait here for me.

49
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:24,040
When I give the signal, come out.

50
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,399
All right.

51
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:53,639
Stop! The King is with her.

52
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:54,959
Move!

53
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,560
Your Majesty.

54
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,399
Where are you going? I'll take you.

55
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,160
You're hurt.

56
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,800
I'm fine. I just need a little rest.

57
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,839
Hang in there.

58
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:58,920
Okay.

59
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:15,439
It's a tribal Warrior Medal.

60
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,319
Only a true warrior

61
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,800
is worthy of this medal.

62
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,279
Wei Tian,

63
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:33,439
where on earth are you?

64
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,600
They said you got shot and something happened to you,

65
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,600
but I don't believe it.

66
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:48,240
Just like I don't believe you'd really leave me.

67
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:55,319
Besides, you signed an agreement with me.

68
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:57,519
But now,

69
00:06:58,079 --> 00:07:00,160
none of the people who signed it are here.

70
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,240
Sha Lan isn't here.

71
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,240
Sister Rossi and Uncle Qu aren't here either.

72
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:07,519
Now, the only person who can

73
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:10,279
fulfill this agreement is you.

74
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:19,399
But I don't know where you are.

75
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:23,800
Please come back soon.

76
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:13,560
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

77
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,560
My child...

78
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:27,560
Mom!

79
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:31,839
Mom!

80
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:35,799
Mom!

81
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:38,159
My child...

82
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:41,159
Mom!

83
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:46,559
Mom!

84
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:52,000
Is anyone there? Help!

85
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,240
Help me!

86
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,159
Is anyone there?

87
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:03,399
Help! Somebody help!

88
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:07,639
Help! Help!

89
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:12,159
Help!

90
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:23,840
You're awake. Want a beer?

91
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:34,000
Hades, you got what you wanted.

92
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:37,159
You've captured me.

93
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:39,080
You should actually be thanking me.

94
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:42,200
I stopped my men from killing you.

95
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,399
I have some great news for you.

96
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,799
This person looks familiar.

97
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,080
Recognize her?

98
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,240
Rossi!

99
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,600
Want me to bring it closer

100
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,120
so you can see better?

101
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,200
She's quite pretty.

102
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,960
Isn't she the racer from Silent Protectors?

103
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,559
She died in a car. Are you still not satisfied?

104
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,039
Not satisfied?

105
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,559
If you're not satisfied,

106
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:34,000
tell me beforehand next time.

107
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,440
I'll do my best to accommodate you.

108
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:41,320
Wei Tian, I don't owe you a single thing.

109
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,200
But remember this:

110
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,919
You'll owe me forever.

111
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,720
You're finally awake.

112
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,320
Your Majesty.

113
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:32,399
Your Majesty.

114
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:35,000
Did you bandage my wound?

115
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,360
But where did this bandage come from?

116
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,159
The driver

117
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:42,799
brought us here,

118
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,240
and bought medicine and food.

119
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,200
So,

120
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,440
you've thought it through and decided to leave?

121
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,320
I won't let down those who support me.

122
00:11:58,799 --> 00:11:59,639
Your Majesty.

123
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,320
I'll contact the Zhong An branch now

124
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,720
to come and meet us.

125
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,120
Helen.

126
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:14,399
Helen, are you all right?

127
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,320
Shen Yu? Is that you?

128
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:18,039
Xiao Bei and I have reached Antilocaris

129
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,519
to assist you with the mission.

130
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,799
Helen, it's Xiang Bei.

131
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,720
The situation is critical.

132
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,840
How are you and the King?

133
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:26,720
Xiang Bei.

134
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,240
The reason why

135
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,559
I hadn't contacted you

136
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,600
was to keep Zhong An out of this.

137
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,639
But now your location has already been exposed.

138
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:35,039
Wanted posters of you are everywhere.

139
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,799
I know.

140
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,960
Did anyone give you trouble?

141
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:40,200
Not really.

142
00:12:40,279 --> 00:12:41,039
It's just that earlier,

143
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:42,519
a crowd of misled citizens

144
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,519
came demanding the King's release.

145
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,759
Shen Yu already sent them away.

146
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:48,960
Is there an emergency on your end?

147
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,639
Here's the situation.

148
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:54,200
I must protect King José Limón

149
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,159
and get him out of Antilocaris via the airport.

150
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,600
We need your backup now.

151
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,559
Copy that. We'll follow your lead.

152
00:13:57,679 --> 00:14:00,240
With you friends from Zhong An helping us,

153
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:02,720
I can reach the airport safely.

154
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:06,000
Your Majesty, it's too early to thank us.

155
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,480
Wait until you board the plane

156
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,919
and land safely before you say that.

157
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:13,759
Shen Yu, don't you think something feels off?

158
00:14:16,919 --> 00:14:18,399
Aren't you just being too nervous?

159
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,279
They're out in the open, while we're in the shadows.

160
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:22,399
Besides, Xiao Bei is keeping a close watch.

161
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:24,440
If anything happens, he'll let us know right away.

162
00:14:42,759 --> 00:14:44,360
Armed patrols across the city

163
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:46,399
have doubled,

164
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:48,519
yet they still dare to show up at the market!

165
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:49,559
Tell me why.

166
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:51,159
Why haven't we found them yet?

167
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,320
Those who stopped them on the street that day

168
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:56,320
have all been rewarded.

169
00:14:56,559 --> 00:14:58,799
Everyone knows the reward is real now.

170
00:14:58,799 --> 00:15:00,200
They definitely can't escape.

171
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:06,080
Sir, orders have been sent to the police.

172
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,519
They're ready to assist with the arrest anytime.

173
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:13,320
The people at the market

174
00:15:13,759 --> 00:15:15,440
are just a distraction.

175
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:17,759
Right now, Helen must be trying

176
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:18,919
to get the King out.

177
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,559
On every route leading out

178
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:22,639
of Antilocaris,

179
00:15:22,639 --> 00:15:24,360
we've already set up checkpoints.

180
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,559
Are there enough men at the airport?

181
00:15:34,159 --> 00:15:36,440
King José Limón's forces at the airport

182
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,240
have all been replaced.

183
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:41,559
Nothing unusual from Zhong An.

184
00:15:41,559 --> 00:15:43,080
Only one car left during this time.

185
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,320
Shen Yu was the only one inside.

186
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:46,240
Are you sure he was alone?

187
00:15:46,399 --> 00:15:47,200
He was alone.

188
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:53,320
Looks like we should ask the police chief for a favor.

189
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,240
Stop the car.

190
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,360
Mr. Shen,

191
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,759
the chief told us to wait for you here

192
00:16:18,759 --> 00:16:20,639
to discuss airport security.

193
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,320
Is there a problem at the airport?

194
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,759
What are you doing here?

195
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,759
Sorry, I have no idea.

196
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:45,320
Are you okay?

197
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,240
I'm fine.

198
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,320
Good thing I had body armor on.

199
00:16:48,919 --> 00:16:50,320
Looks like the police were bought off too.

200
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:51,440
Of course.

201
00:16:51,759 --> 00:16:53,840
Right now, you're the closest thing to that bounty.

202
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:54,919
Get in.

203
00:17:06,759 --> 00:17:08,440
Xiao Bei, we need backup.

204
00:17:09,599 --> 00:17:11,519
Do you think I'm that slow on the uptake?

205
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,640
You should trust our teamwork.

206
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:26,039
Shen Yu, a vehicle's coming.

207
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:31,519
It's a truck. Highly suspicious.

208
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:38,920
Our reinforcements are here.

209
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,240
Shen Yu, they're closing in! What do we do?

210
00:18:15,559 --> 00:18:16,799
They just keep coming!

211
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:19,400
Don't worry, we still have some spike strips in the car.

212
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:01,359
Hello.

213
00:19:01,359 --> 00:19:02,240
ID, please.

214
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,319
What ID?

215
00:19:03,359 --> 00:19:04,759
Give me your ID.

216
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,839
Do I need an ID to go to the airport?

217
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:07,960
Of course you do.

218
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,079
Give me your ID.

219
00:19:13,039 --> 00:19:14,680
Shen Yu, it's Hades' men.

220
00:19:17,119 --> 00:19:17,920
Move, move!

221
00:19:37,519 --> 00:19:38,559
Where are we going now?

222
00:19:40,839 --> 00:19:42,119
Given the current situation,

223
00:19:42,559 --> 00:19:44,599
nowhere except Zhong An

224
00:19:44,599 --> 00:19:45,559
can shelter the King.

225
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:47,440
This is a terrorist attack targeting me.

226
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,440
And now,

227
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:50,519
it has put your lives at risk.

228
00:19:50,599 --> 00:19:51,640
I feel terrible about this.

229
00:19:52,039 --> 00:19:54,599
Zhong An shouldn't have to face such danger.

230
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:55,960
Your Majesty, don't feel guilty.

231
00:19:56,519 --> 00:19:57,440
To us,

232
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:59,160
it's not just you we must protect,

233
00:19:59,319 --> 00:20:00,000
there's also Phase Two

234
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,680
of Zhonggang Group's pipeline project.

235
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:02,680
Your safety directly

236
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,000
impacts the port's completion.

237
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:06,480
That's why we will do everything we can

238
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,519
to keep you safe.

239
00:20:28,279 --> 00:20:29,720
How are they on our tail already?

240
00:20:29,759 --> 00:20:31,160
They just won't let up.

241
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,119
Hello?

242
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:06,000
Shen Yu, is this your backup?

243
00:21:08,599 --> 00:21:10,640
Xiao Bei, did you send these people?

244
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:13,000
Looks like the captain is back.

245
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,519
Uncle Qu.

246
00:21:39,799 --> 00:21:42,079
Xiao Bei, our tail's been cleared.

247
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,680
We're heading back to Zhong An now.

248
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:45,279
Copy that.

249
00:21:46,599 --> 00:21:48,519
Attention, all personnel. Attention, all personnel.

250
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,240
Switch to full defense mode.

251
00:21:50,279 --> 00:21:51,599
Go to Level One combat readiness.

252
00:22:03,799 --> 00:22:04,599
Welcome home.

253
00:22:18,319 --> 00:22:20,119
Uncle Qu, Helen, Shen Yu.

254
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:21,400
Are the three of you okay?

255
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:22,720
The three of us are fine,

256
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,279
but His Majesty was badly shaken.

257
00:22:24,279 --> 00:22:25,480
He's gone to rest now.

258
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,480
Uncle Qu...

259
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:31,920
Didn't Sister Rossi come back with you?

260
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:38,960
Rossi...

261
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:42,920
She was killed.

262
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,039
What did you say?

263
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:53,599
Rossi saved the neighboring crown prince

264
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:55,599
from Hades' clutches,

265
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:59,160
and Hades retaliated against her.

266
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,119
Hades again!

267
00:23:08,319 --> 00:23:10,599
We haven't even settled the score for my brother and Sha Lan!

268
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,400
Does anyone have news on Wei Tian?

269
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:17,119
We sent several squads to search for him,

270
00:23:18,799 --> 00:23:19,880
but there's been no word.

271
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:24,000
But right now, we have another problem:

272
00:23:24,599 --> 00:23:26,400
His Majesty's location at Zhong An

273
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,799
has likely already been compromised.

274
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,799
We have to come up with a plan.

275
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:34,079
Then let's find Hades and end this once and for all!

276
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:16,680
Let's go.

277
00:25:07,279 --> 00:25:08,279
All right, let's move.

278
00:25:34,839 --> 00:25:36,160
Perimeter electric fence check complete.

279
00:25:37,079 --> 00:25:38,079
Copy that.

280
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:39,640
Perimeter personnel, fall back inside.

281
00:25:47,839 --> 00:25:48,920
Why are there so many people?

282
00:25:49,079 --> 00:25:50,720
Didn't we just send a group off this morning?

283
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:53,599
I suspect Hades' men are among them.

284
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:58,960
Right, exactly.

285
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:01,519
Hurry!

286
00:26:11,599 --> 00:26:13,160
Within firing range. Return fire!

287
00:26:28,799 --> 00:26:30,519
Alright, everyone, listen up.

288
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:32,279
Action Teams One through Three,

289
00:26:32,279 --> 00:26:33,440
fall back to the building entrance.

290
00:26:33,599 --> 00:26:35,480
Special Action Team, move to the high ground.

291
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:57,119
All teams, report in.

292
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:59,079
Team One in position. All clear.

293
00:26:59,519 --> 00:27:01,240
Team Two in position. All clear.

294
00:27:01,319 --> 00:27:03,000
Team Three in position. All clear.

295
00:27:04,519 --> 00:27:05,759
The people of Antilocaris

296
00:27:05,799 --> 00:27:06,880
are all armed.

297
00:27:07,319 --> 00:27:09,200
Unless they draw weapons first,

298
00:27:09,279 --> 00:27:10,799
we cannot open fire.

299
00:27:12,279 --> 00:27:13,519
All Zhong An personnel, hear this:

300
00:27:13,799 --> 00:27:15,400
Hold your fire unless absolutely necessary.

301
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,480
Copy that.

302
00:27:19,559 --> 00:27:20,400
Heads up.

303
00:27:20,599 --> 00:27:22,200
About 20 to 30 targets

304
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,079
closing in.

305
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,240
Let's go.

306
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:15,839
Xiao Bei, are you okay?

307
00:28:15,839 --> 00:28:16,599
I'm fine.

308
00:28:16,839 --> 00:28:18,440
Uncle Qu, are you all right over there?

309
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:19,799
I'm good.

310
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:22,599
Captain, Xiao Bei, enemy fire is too heavy!

311
00:28:23,079 --> 00:28:24,000
We can barely hold them off!

312
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,519
Should we fall back downstairs?

313
00:28:25,839 --> 00:28:27,440
No, not yet.

314
00:28:27,559 --> 00:28:30,640
Right, visibility isn't as good down there.

315
00:28:33,119 --> 00:28:33,920
All units, report.

316
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,440
Team One, all clear.

317
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:38,839
Team Three, all clear. Nothing unusual.

318
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:40,119
Copy.

319
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:42,400
That was just their first wave.

320
00:28:42,519 --> 00:28:44,000
The next wave will hit any minute.

321
00:28:45,799 --> 00:28:47,440
The drone must've captured it earlier.

322
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,559
At least 30 men were firing at us.

323
00:28:52,279 --> 00:28:53,079
Boss.

324
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:58,279
Why haven't you breached Zhong An Group yet?

325
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:05,160
They refused to authorize lethal weapons.

326
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,440
They're afraid of harming the king.

327
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,799
Useless fools.

328
00:29:10,319 --> 00:29:11,319
Ignore them.

329
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,200
Understood.

330
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,319
What's that sound?

331
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,839
Just some local herders.

332
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:38,000
We can't keep going like this.

333
00:29:38,519 --> 00:29:41,640
If Walter's troops break in,

334
00:29:42,519 --> 00:29:43,720
we're finished.

335
00:29:44,559 --> 00:29:46,240
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

336
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:48,079
I won't let you fall into their hands.

337
00:29:48,079 --> 00:29:50,319
You've already done more than enough.

338
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:53,599
I think their siege on the Zhong An branch...

339
00:29:53,599 --> 00:29:55,519
should be made known to more people.

340
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:57,000
To more people?

341
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:08,480
Get down!

342
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:38,680
Team One, please respond.

343
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,240
Team One, do you copy?

344
00:30:42,839 --> 00:30:44,079
Against firepower like this,

345
00:30:44,119 --> 00:30:45,319
we can't hold out.

346
00:30:45,519 --> 00:30:47,079
Should we evacuate this rooftop?

347
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:48,359
Not until the very last second.

348
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:49,559
I won't give up on Zhong An.

349
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:52,039
Now's not the time to go head-to-head!

350
00:30:52,039 --> 00:30:53,839
We're completely cut off and on our own!

351
00:30:57,599 --> 00:30:58,920
If only Rossi were here.

352
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:00,680
She could definitely secure

353
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,799
international humanitarian aid.

354
00:31:02,319 --> 00:31:03,119
Rossi...

355
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:10,720
I just saved this country's crown prince,

356
00:31:11,039 --> 00:31:13,559
and even got a card that grants any favor.

357
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:32,160
Listen up, I've already uploaded our situation

358
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:33,200
to the internet.

359
00:31:33,319 --> 00:31:35,319
We must call for outside help right now.

360
00:31:36,039 --> 00:31:37,319
No one's coming now!

361
00:31:37,799 --> 00:31:38,880
Against firepower like this,

362
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:40,319
only regular troops can hold them off.

363
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:42,440
Helen!

364
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,319
I just sent you a contact.

365
00:31:44,519 --> 00:31:47,000
Call this number right now to request rescue!

366
00:31:47,359 --> 00:31:48,200
Okay.

367
00:31:51,799 --> 00:31:53,559
Captain, whose number is this?

368
00:31:53,880 --> 00:31:55,279
It doesn't matter whose it is anymore!

369
00:31:55,279 --> 00:31:56,000
Just hurry up!

370
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,880
This is our last chance. Make the call!

371
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:58,799
Okay, understood.

372
00:32:06,559 --> 00:32:08,720
Xiao Bei, that's a heavy machine gun!

373
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:09,920
All personnel, listen up!

374
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,440
Fall back into the building immediately!

375
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,640
Fall back into the building immediately!

376
00:32:27,279 --> 00:32:28,799
Your Majesty, we can't stay here.

377
00:32:28,839 --> 00:32:30,240
Hades has deployed lethal weapons.

378
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:31,359
Zhong An can't hold out any longer.

379
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:32,519
Get His Majesty out of here first.

380
00:32:32,519 --> 00:32:33,480
I'll be right behind you.

381
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:34,519
Here, take this.

382
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:35,359
Follow me.

383
00:32:35,359 --> 00:32:36,279
Your Majesty, let's go.

384
00:32:36,279 --> 00:32:36,880
All right.

385
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:37,519
Hurry!

386
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,119
Go now, I'll cover you!

387
00:32:55,200 --> 00:32:56,000
Go!

388
00:33:24,559 --> 00:33:25,359
It's me.

389
00:33:25,599 --> 00:33:27,039
Shen Yu, what are you doing here?

390
00:33:27,799 --> 00:33:29,000
The Captain and Xiao Bei had me cover the rear.

391
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:29,559
Hurry, let's move!

392
00:33:29,559 --> 00:33:30,200
All right.

393
00:33:36,319 --> 00:33:37,119
Let's go!

394
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:01,799
You okay?

395
00:34:01,799 --> 00:34:02,359
I'm fine.

396
00:34:02,359 --> 00:34:02,799
Let's go.

397
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:03,319
Okay.

398
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,079
Move.

399
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:18,320
Captain, are the reinforcements you brought in reliable?

400
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,199
Don't worry.

401
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:20,920
That's the secret weapon

402
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,519
Sister Rossi left us.

403
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:25,079
Sister Rossi is watching over us.

404
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:26,599
Let's move.

405
00:34:36,039 --> 00:34:37,599
Xiao Bei, cover the King!

406
00:34:37,599 --> 00:34:38,239
Got it!

407
00:34:44,119 --> 00:34:44,920
Move!

408
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:46,880
Hurry, move!

409
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,280
Move!

410
00:35:05,599 --> 00:35:06,400
Go!

411
00:35:27,559 --> 00:35:29,480
I worked hard making this all morning.

412
00:35:29,639 --> 00:35:31,000
At least eat a little bit.

413
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:32,599
Look at the news.

414
00:35:32,639 --> 00:35:34,000
How can you still eat?

415
00:35:34,679 --> 00:35:36,440
The news? What about it?

416
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:37,599
Didn't the news say

417
00:35:37,599 --> 00:35:39,920
Wei Tian colluded with Zhong An to kidnap the king?

418
00:35:42,679 --> 00:35:44,559
That... that news is total nonse—

419
00:35:44,559 --> 00:35:45,400
Keep it down!

420
00:35:47,519 --> 00:35:49,280
Can't you see how worried she is?

421
00:35:49,360 --> 00:35:50,840
She didn't sleep at all last night.

422
00:36:01,320 --> 00:36:02,320
We're here.

423
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:10,639
Get in the car!

424
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:12,239
Okay, hurry!

425
00:36:12,719 --> 00:36:13,519
Move!

426
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:22,000
Reinforcements are here!

427
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,079
Alright, let's go.

428
00:37:06,559 --> 00:37:07,360
Anda,

429
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:09,800
that post you just put up was great.

430
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:11,880
That's the way to do it.

431
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:14,679
Let the public know it was Hades who harmed him.

432
00:37:17,199 --> 00:37:19,119
Hades didn't care if the King lived or died,

433
00:37:19,199 --> 00:37:20,840
striking the Zhong An camp with heavy firepower.

434
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,639
There's widespread public outrage now.

435
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:25,800
Now Zhong An won't have to take the fall.

436
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:29,119
Thank you. Thank you.

437
00:37:30,079 --> 00:37:32,000
Thank you. Thank you.

438
00:37:32,199 --> 00:37:33,000
Mr. Xiang.

439
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:35,079
The Zhong An branch has been blown up.

440
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,559
We just discussed it.

441
00:37:36,599 --> 00:37:40,199
I'll take you to neighboring Libania.

442
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,039
Our mission isn't over yet.

443
00:37:42,199 --> 00:37:42,960
Rather,

444
00:37:42,960 --> 00:37:44,719
our mission to escort you is over,

445
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:47,039
but Zhong An's mission isn't finished yet.

446
00:37:48,639 --> 00:37:49,800
Mr. Qu Shengli,

447
00:37:50,039 --> 00:37:52,360
our honorable Prince Obida

448
00:37:52,519 --> 00:37:55,519
asked me to extend his sincere regards to you.

449
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:58,599
All right, thank him for me as well.

450
00:37:59,199 --> 00:38:00,199
Tell him

451
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:02,599
his friendship with Rossi was truly worth it.

452
00:38:02,599 --> 00:38:03,239
Understood.

453
00:38:03,639 --> 00:38:05,239
Thank you. Goodbye.

454
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:39,599
Get in!

455
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:40,480
Got it.

456
00:38:48,599 --> 00:38:49,840
Pull everyone back.

457
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:50,480
Yes, sir.

458
00:39:02,239 --> 00:39:04,119
They have nowhere left to hide.

459
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:07,320
If we pursue them now, we'll definitely catch them.

460
00:39:08,679 --> 00:39:10,000
Even if we catch them now,

461
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:11,400
it won't mean anything anymore.

462
00:39:27,599 --> 00:39:28,519
You broke your word.

463
00:39:28,519 --> 00:39:30,800
You promised not to use lethal weapons.

464
00:39:30,840 --> 00:39:32,480
Only the victor reigns supreme.

465
00:39:32,840 --> 00:39:34,719
You should kill José Limón.

466
00:39:35,000 --> 00:39:37,400
That way, his new policy will collapse on its own.

467
00:39:38,079 --> 00:39:40,000
For a businessman who only cares about profit,

468
00:39:40,199 --> 00:39:42,199
why care about what others say?

469
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,800
You're shameless.

470
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,599
Until next time.

471
00:40:02,039 --> 00:40:03,079
Where are we going now?

472
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,719
Let's go to the Plato Hotel first.

473
00:40:04,719 --> 00:40:06,119
Anda's already called so many times.

474
00:40:06,119 --> 00:40:07,199
She's really worried about us.

475
00:40:11,639 --> 00:40:12,920
Helen, how are you doing?

476
00:40:15,679 --> 00:40:17,719
Looks like my old wound reopened.

477
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:20,039
Should we find a place to bandage it?

478
00:40:20,039 --> 00:40:20,719
We can't take any chances.

479
00:40:20,719 --> 00:40:21,360
That's right.

480
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:23,119
If it gets infected, we're in trouble.

481
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:25,840
Medicine is scarce now, so we must treat it at once.

482
00:40:26,199 --> 00:40:27,280
Let's hurry back to the Plato Hotel.

483
00:40:41,639 --> 00:40:42,559
What do you want?

484
00:40:42,599 --> 00:40:43,480
Behave yourselves!

485
00:40:45,199 --> 00:40:46,000
Move!

486
00:40:47,679 --> 00:40:48,480
What's going on?

487
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,079
Look over there.

488
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:56,559
What are you doing? Let us go!

489
00:40:56,599 --> 00:40:57,599
Some Chinese people are being robbed.

490
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,320
Xiao Bei, let's go check it out.

491
00:40:59,320 --> 00:40:59,960
Okay.

492
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:01,440
Captain, take good care of Helen.

493
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:02,079
Got it.

494
00:41:13,119 --> 00:41:13,679
Stop!

495
00:41:13,679 --> 00:41:14,320
The money!

496
00:41:16,519 --> 00:41:17,519
Who are you?

497
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:19,639
We're Security Officers from Zhong An Security Group,

498
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:21,440
tasked with protecting overseas Chinese.

499
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:22,840
You're Zhong An Security Officers?

500
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,159
That's right.

501
00:41:24,159 --> 00:41:24,920
Get them!

502
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:40,440
I'll go down and take a look.

503
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:00,320
Move, move! Hurry!

504
00:42:03,119 --> 00:42:04,119
Here's your bag.

505
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,800
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

506
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:06,960
Thank you so much!

507
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:08,079
It's all thanks to you.

508
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:10,039
All our family's passports and bank cards...

509
00:42:10,039 --> 00:42:11,039
...are in that bag.

510
00:42:11,400 --> 00:42:13,599
Carrying so much in this wartime chaos...

511
00:42:13,679 --> 00:42:14,800
Where are you heading?

512
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:16,400
We had no choice. We're business people.

513
00:42:16,599 --> 00:42:18,199
We fled here from José City,

514
00:42:18,599 --> 00:42:20,079
thinking it would be safer.

515
00:42:20,199 --> 00:42:21,400
We planned to come here

516
00:42:21,719 --> 00:42:22,679
and stay at the Chinese-owned

517
00:42:22,679 --> 00:42:23,840
Plato Hotel first,

518
00:42:23,960 --> 00:42:25,960
then wait for a flight back home.

519
00:42:26,119 --> 00:42:27,679
We never expected to get robbed.

520
00:42:27,679 --> 00:42:28,639
Thank goodness you were here.

521
00:42:28,639 --> 00:42:30,280
How is the situation in José City right now?

522
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:33,000
Terrorist militants have seized the entire city.

523
00:42:33,039 --> 00:42:34,159
It's complete chaos in there now.

524
00:42:34,199 --> 00:42:36,079
About how many people are outside the city?

525
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:38,119
Probably several dozen.

526
00:42:38,119 --> 00:42:39,679
No, at least a hundred.

527
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:42,199
Could you take us outside the city to check?

528
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:43,360
No need. Look,

529
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:45,199
the Plato Hotel you're looking for

530
00:42:45,199 --> 00:42:45,880
is just up ahead.

531
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:46,880
Go on, head over.

532
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,280
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

533
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:48,880
Thank you all!

534
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:49,639
Let's go, let's go.

535
00:42:51,039 --> 00:42:51,800
Helen! Helen!

536
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:52,480
Sister Helen!

537
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:53,960
You're not healed yet. Don't go!

538
00:42:54,199 --> 00:42:55,840
I'm fine. Our compatriots need us.

539
00:42:56,239 --> 00:42:58,199
My injury is nothing. Let's make it quick.

540
00:42:59,400 --> 00:43:00,239
Get in the car, then.

541
00:43:00,239 --> 00:43:00,880
All right, let's go.

542
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:01,519
Move out!
